      },
      "message": "fix(ui): show the one radial-step field each pocket strategy reads\n\nAdaptive and Offset rings step by Optimal load and never read Stepover;\nthe Passes tab showed both, so a Stepover edit looked ignored. The page\nnow shows Stepover only for Zigzag / Waterline / Auto and Optimal load\nonly for Adaptive / Offset rings (Pocket, 3D Pocket, rotary offset,\nmulti-axis rough, 2D Adaptive), driven by PocketStrategy::steps_by_load,\nthe same predicate the generators use. The 3D diameter check no longer\nrefuses a stale, unread stepover under the load strategies. The\npast-reach refusal names the field and both values. Entry Engagement\nand the trochoid Forward step get hints saying what they change.\n\nFixes #1512\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
